hub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100808.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR refers to [Make GeometryInstance3D accessible for custom Geometry Scenes ](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11252) (and implementing the alternative approach)\r\n\r\nThere is a virtual method `_get_aabb` in VisualInstance3D->MeshInstance3D that cannot be used in GDScript anymore because it is routed to the Mesh. If there is no Mesh an empty AABB is returned. This PR fixes this so that if there is no Mesh, the GDScript overriden `_get_aabb` in MeshInstance3D is used.\r\n\r\n[[debug]meshinstance3d_get_aabb.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18253196/debug.meshinstance3d_get_aabb.zip)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100808/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100808/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}